# Docs screenshot: the Level tab (docs/editor/level.md, #45) on the demo
# project's HighForest.ldtk.
wait 5
key escape
click @root.level
wait 3
click @level.open:levels/HighForest.ldtk
wait 10
click @level.layer:Ground
click @level.fit
wait 3
annotate @root.level Game / Level tabs (Cmd+Shift+1 / 2)
annotate @level.tool.Brush Tools: B R E F I V M
annotate @window:level-levels Levels: the world's levels
annotate @window:level-canvas Canvas: paint and place in the active level
annotate @window:level-layers Layers, and the active layer's palette
annotate @window:level-panel Level Panel: world, level and the definitions
screenshot editor_level
click @menu:Help
click @menu:Help/Help for This Panel
expect noderef.page == editor/level
